  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ConversationMemory
  maxTurns: 6
  openingSentence: "Ah\u2026 a Human. We do not often get time to truly listen to
    one another, stay here with me for a while. You see an elephant standing before
    you, but I also carry generations of memory. We elephants survive by remembering.
    Humans survive by changing. Maybe that is why we misunderstand each other sometimes?"
